<title>UK: Thorn debut H1 operating profit up.</title>
<headline>Thorn debut H1 operating profit up.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		12.0		   vs 10.9</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 3.7		    vs 3.4</p>
<p> Operating profit before exceps</p>
<p>				87		     vs 78.7</p>
<p> Pretax		     37.8		   vs 71.5</p>
<p> Turnover		   785.1		  vs 733.9</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts' forecasts on pre-tax profits were in a range of 75 to 86.5 million stg. The company said it took an exceptional charge at the operating level of 32.9 million stg.  </p>
<p> Exceptional charge     32.9		   vs nil</p>
<p> Interest		   7.7		    vs 7.2</p>
<p> Non-recurring charge   9.5		    vs nil</p>
<p> Tax			  24.8		   vs 25.0</p>
<p> Net taxed		  13.0		   vs 46.5</p>
<p> Pay date		   February 28, 1997</p>
<p> Div registration date  January 14, 1997</p>
<p> Ex-div date		January 6, 1997</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
